{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/m90b6t0r","slideIndex":9,"text":"Across our benchmark suite on Apple M5 hardware, our custom Rust pass matches or outperforms LLVM's mature LoopVectorize, delivering a 3.009x geomean speedup. Notice write_index_u64, where stock LLVM misjudged the cost model, yielding a 102.8% performance advantage for our pass."}